  "ModelKit Parallel provides an optional Domainslib execution backend for deterministic bounded cross-validation."
maintainer: ["Asara developers <devs@asara.io>"]
authors: ["Asara"]
license: "Apache-2.0"
tags: ["data-science" "machine-learning" "parallelism"]
